# arm: voice-loose
# typed notes stay as written; dictated ones may lose a false start from the middle
# created 2026-08-14. Deltas from the base; everything unlisted falls through.
#
# Runs every day beside the base, into sync/Obsidian/Posts/voice-loose/.
# bin/arm.sh promote voice-loose folds these into profiles/base.env.

CURATE_DIRECTIVE=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/directives/voice-loose.md
VOICE_TWEAK_GAP=8
# The one that matters. Dictated sentences may be genuinely REWORDED, not just
# cut, provided half the wording of the spoken sentence they restate survives —
# which is what keeps a rewrite anchored to something he actually said. Typed
# notes get none of this: the asymmetry IS the experiment.
VOICE_REWRITE_MIN=50
